      "value": "remove EAC at all, as FBT mute person and avatar maker i have to use mods to fix fbt, place mirror, fast find my friends by tp func and stuff and TTS from windows, and now they telling that they will ban me for doing that. but the problem is, EAC does not work, in any game its just not works. its been 2 hours since release, and its already bypassed by malicios people with crash cheats. good job vrchat, you never been fucked up that much",
